# Icons

Third-party icons remain subject to their respective licenses. For licenses regarding each icon, please see the licensing information of the external dependency that provides the icon.

Following npm dependencies provide icon files that are licensed under CC BY 4.0:
  - https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/fontawesome-svg-core
  - https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-brands-svg-icons
  - https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-regular-svg-icons
  - https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-solid-svg-icons

---

# Fonts

Third-party fonts remain subject to their respective licenses. For licenses regarding each font, please see the licensing information of the external dependency that provides the font.

Following npm dependencies provide font files that are licensed under SIL OFL 1.1 License:

- https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/fontawesome-svg-core
- https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-brands-svg-icons
- https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-regular-svg-icons
- https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fortawesome/free-solid-svg-icons

---

# Third-party dependency notes

Third-party dependencies, including build-time tooling and associated assets, remain subject to their respective licenses.

Notable third-party licenses differing from the project's MIT license include, but are not limited to:

- CC-BY-4.0 (caniuse-lite, a transitive dependency of @vitejs/plugin-react)
- MPL-2.0 (lightningcss, a transitive dependency of @tailwindcss/vite)
- Python-2.0 (argparse, a transitive dependency of eslint)

